      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاؤُوا بِحَشَكَتِهِمْ</span></b> , (K,) or, as in the Moheet,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ فُلَانٌ بِحَشَكَتِهِمْ</span>, (TA,) means (assumed tropical:)  [<i>They came,</i>
